---
/*
 * English changelog (P2 batch 7, 2026-10-17). English is built but noindex since the 2026-10-15
 * rebuild, so this is a short mirror of /zh/changelog/ for visitors who arrive through the language
 * switcher. The Traditional Chinese page is the full record; if the two disagree, it is right.
 */
import ArticleLayout from '../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';
import { localizedPath } from '../../i18n/utils';

const locale = 'en';
---

<ArticleLayout
  title="WorthCalc changelog and corrections"
  description="What WorthCalc actually changed, by date: pages added, rewritten, merged or retired, and the errors that were corrected."
  locale={locale}
  updated="2026-10-18"
  alternateLocales={['en', 'zh']}
>
  <p>
    This page records what WorthCalc actually changed: pages added, rewritten, merged or retired, and errors that were corrected.
    Dates are the days the change was merged to the main branch and went live (Taiwan time). It carries no traffic or revenue figures.
    If you find a wrong number, <a href={localizedPath(locale, '/contact')}>write to us</a>; the fix is recorded here and the page's check date is updated.
    The Traditional Chinese changelog is the full record.
  </p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-10-18">2026-10-18</time> – The "assumptions" and "example" blocks on the commute-cost, electric-scooter-versus-gas and credit-card cashback break-even calculators
      described a different set of default values than the inputs actually use. They now describe the real defaults. The scooter calculator's default subsidy was changed from 3,000 to 0 and points to the official subsidy page.
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-10-18">2026-10-18</time> – The appliance running-cost list presented 43 wattages as sourced when they were US references and in-house examples.
      Four (refrigerator, dehumidifier, single-unit air conditioner, monitor) are now computed from the Energy Administration's open data; the other 39 are labelled as demonstration values.
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-10-17">2026-10-17</time> – Costco: the old text said alcohol and telecom purchases are excluded from the 2% reward; the official exclusion list has neither. Corrected to the official list.
      Unsourced statements about late-payment interest and prepayment penalties were removed or replaced with citations. The labour-pension monthly-payout field is now labelled as a non-official illustration.
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-10-17">2026-10-17</time> – Credit-card revolving interest: the old generic calculator defaulted to 20.9% compounded, above the 15% statutory cap in Taiwan's Banking Act;
      replaced by a Taiwan-specific calculator.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>History</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><time datetime="2026-10-18">2026-10-18</time> – Directory pages rewritten and grouped by situation; emergency-fund and true-hourly-wage pages rebuilt for Taiwan; savings-goal guides merged into the compound-growth calculator; the five oldest-checked pages re-verified.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-10-17">2026-10-17</time> – Page-by-page rebuild (first five batches): labour pension, labour insurance annuity, revolving interest, installment, mortgage and refinance calculators; Costco, membership, warranty and repair pages; several overlapping pages merged into the calculators and redirected.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-10-16">2026-10-16</time> – 35 pages removed and 19 merged and redirected; retired-language content deleted. Sitemap 143 to 89 pages.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-10-15">2026-10-15</time> – Rebuilt as a Taiwan money-decision site in Traditional Chinese. English left the search index; Spanish, French, German, Hindi and Arabic were retired. Sitemap 254 to 143 pages. Scheduled releases stopped.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-10-07">2026-10-07</time> – Versions 1.0.1 and 1.0.2 (small fixes). These are the last version tags; changes are dated from here on. Earlier versions of this page listed 1.1.0 and 1.2.0, which were never tagged.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-09-22">2026-09-22</time> – Spanish, French and German stopped being indexed.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-09-15">2026-09-15</time> – Consolidation of duplicate pages: 1,233 URLs inventoried, most set to noindex, sitemap reduced to 304 pages.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-09-01">2026-09-01</time> to <time datetime="2026-09-03">2026-09-03</time> – A large batch of topic pages (appliance running costs and similar); most were later noindexed or retired.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-07-18">2026-07-18</time> to <time datetime="2026-07-19">2026-07-19</time> – 29 decision topics in five languages. This stage was retired on 2026-10-15.</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-07-03">2026-07-03</time> – Launch at worthcalc.win with eight calculators and four guides in English and Traditional Chinese.</li>
  </ul>
</ArticleLayout>
